{
  "name": "CRM · Any form → contact + sequence",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Form intake\nPoint Typeform, Webflow, Elementor, Facebook/Google Lead Ads (via their n8n triggers) or any website form at this Webhook. The contact is created or updated by email, tagged, and optionally enrolled in a CRM sequence.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create an API key in the CRM (Integrations → API keys).\n2. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential named `CRM API key`: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer agp_…`.\n3. Select that credential on every *CRM* HTTP Request node.\n4. Set `crm_url` in the **CRM config** node.\n5. Put a sequence ID in `sequence_id` (see `GET /api/meta`) or leave it empty.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "5bb94896-27d4-5a36-b789-02ef11329a61",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -330
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-intake",
        "options": {}
      },
